@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Call resolution — evidence records are broader than graph topology

start
:CodePropertyGraph
Call syntax + AST parents;<<#DBE4FF>>
:build_symbol_table
bounded functions · imports · scopes;<<#C3FAE8>>
:sort calls by NodeId
reconstruct name from first AST child subtree;<<#FFE8CC>>
:classify evidence
lexical → import → bare name;<<#FFF3BF>>
:record CallGraphResolution
for every processed call;<<#E5DBFF>>

if (unique approved evidence tier?) then (yes)
  :set Call.target
  emit labeled Reference +
  Static/Dynamic + CallSite;<<#D3F9D8>>
  :call SCCs + callers/callees
  interprocedural DFG;<<#D0BFFF>>
else (ambiguous / external / unresolved)
  :leave target empty
  emit no resolution or call edge;<<#FFC9C9>>
endif
stop

note right
  Approved: ExactInFile, ExactViaImport,
  ExactViaBinding, BareNameUnique.
  Candidate count is measured before truncation.
end note

legend right
  |= colour |= role |
  |<#DBE4FF>| source CPG |
  |<#C3FAE8>| lexical symbols |
  |<#FFE8CC>| syntax evidence |
  |<#FFF3BF>| deterministic classification |
  |<#E5DBFF>| out-of-graph record |
  |<#FFD8A8>| topology boundary |
  |<#D3F9D8>| emitted definite topology |
  |<#FFC9C9>| conservative no-edge outcome |
  |<#D0BFFF>| downstream consumers |
endlegend
@enduml
